// # 5G NR, Software Defined Radio & Signal Processing Facade
//
// Logline: Master standard library facade re-exporting all 49 5G NR physical layer, SDR streaming, MIMO, and DSP submodules.
//
// Setup: Pure standard library facade module importing all telecom_5g domain modules and providing unified system configurations.
//
// Beats:
//   1. Import 49 modular 5G NR LDPC/Polar FEC, OFDM, Massive MIMO, Modulation, Sync, Fading, and DSP submodules.
//   2. Define top-level 5G NR carrier, numerology, and SDR baseband transceiver configuration structures.
//   3. Provide unified factory constructors and API shims for seamless openOODA 5G NR telecom integration.

